cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "hijack-proof-agent: code and results for \"Prompt-Injection Defences on a Small Local Agent: What Works, What It Costs, and How Optimistic Development Numbers Are\""
abstract: >-
  A small local AI agent (Qwen3.5-4B) hardened against indirect prompt injection by an eval-driven
  hillclimb on AgentDojo: the agent and every defence round, the evaluation harness, AgentDojo's
  built-in defences rebuilt for the local model, an automated attacker, the registered protocol with
  the hash of every file it depends on, and every run's results and full transcripts.
